API REFERENCE

# Developer Documentation

Deep dive into the Pathfinder API, Collect.js, and Three-Step Redirect logic.

### Collect.js

Tokenize payment data securely directly from the client browser. Never let raw PAN data touch your servers, achieving the easiest SAQ-A PCI compliance.

```
CollectJS.configure({
  paymentType: "cc",
  callback: function(response) {
    if (response.error) {
      handleError(response);
    } else {
      submitTokenToServer(response.token);
    }
  }
});
```

